}},{"title":"梅花坞二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"古寺灵为谷，前村玉作梅。\n雪香千万树，岁岁得春魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20757,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花坞二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"尽洗铅华态，惟馀冰雪姿。\n和风任披拂，休向笛中吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20758,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰沅道中五首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"结伴曾贪一壑，驱车骤历千山。\n沾衣苍翠欲湿，行云流水同閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20759,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰沅道中五首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"谷口黄茅白雾，岩头绿树苍烟。\n山深禽语未识，时听抱叶鸣蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20760,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰沅道中五首 其三","author":"卢龙云","text":"云起常从马足，风来或送猿声。\n一道红泉树杪，泠然挹濯神清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20761,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰沅道中五首 其四","author":"卢龙云","text":"山下一村雷雨，岩前几阵风云。\n人在翠微深处，披襟涤尽炎氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20762,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰沅道中五首 其五","author":"卢龙云","text":"径转漫疑无路，林开忽复有天。\n立马层厓四望，山容雨过澄鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20763,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风节堂四咏 其一 柳","author":"卢龙云","text":"霜雪长含淑气，林园渐泄春光。\n不教道路攀折，百啭莺同建章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20764,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风节堂四咏 其二 竹","author":"卢龙云","text":"风袅清声万玉，霜淩劲节千竿。\n秀色公馀堪览，飞来更有凤鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20765,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风节堂四咏 其三 桂","author":"卢龙云","text":"深院亭亭独秀，高林冉冉飘香。\n清芬似从月窟，移来最擅群芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20766,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风节堂四咏 其四 柏","author":"卢龙云","text":"曾傍乌台并列，今依法署偏宜。\n岁寒苍翠不改，方知晚节难衰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20767,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊金陵","author":"卢龙云","text":"秣陵佳气郁龙蟠，此地分曹亦汉官。\n自是两都雄帝业，六朝何事总偏安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20768,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京邸忆家","author":"卢龙云","text":"柳色黄金宛宛舒，凝寒方尽已春馀。\n长安万里同为客，归雁曾无记远书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20769,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠台州陈孝廉二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"淮海扁舟忆暮云，三年此地再逢君。\n高情念我能相过，杯酒仍堪细论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20770,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠台州陈孝廉二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"清霜几夕送秋来，南客乡思渺未裁。\n君亦京华同旅邸，夜凉曾否梦天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20771,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赐历","author":"卢龙云","text":"祥风轻袅御炉烟，共祝周家过历年。\n窃食漫逢颁朔会，不知何以答尧天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20772,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行即事二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"舟过维扬雪尽消，片帆南接大江潮。\n梅花两岸飞残腊，转付春风入柳条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20773,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行即事二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"江上兰桡雨后开，山光晴望凤凰台。\n向阳花木欣欣起，无数轻帆带日来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20774,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋见月","author":"卢龙云","text":"客舍秋风日日清，夜来添得月华明。\n一轮会看云间见，能使清辉满凤城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20775,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳城勘荒二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"盘折千山一径穿，诛茅辟石始堪田。\n苍旻若识荒夷苦，岁岁俱应大有年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20776,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳城勘荒二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"鸡骨频占欲满篝，可怜金石若为流。\n中朝定有蠲租诏，不解民间目下愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20777,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"堪舆寄隐卷为麦茂才作四首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"早年声誉遍词林，懒向金门作陆沉。\n小隐不妨泉石侣，薜衣藜杖白云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20778,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"堪舆寄隐卷为麦茂才作四首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"寻常不自混樵苏，负笈新藏五岳图。\n似是向平婚嫁毕，壮心飞动忆蓬壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20779,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"堪舆寄隐卷为麦茂才作四首 其三","author":"卢龙云","text":"僻厓仄径未知还，云水萧然意自閒。\n耻学低眉随世态，独留双眼看名山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20780,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"堪舆寄隐卷为麦茂才作四首 其四","author":"卢龙云","text":"初上罗浮第几峰，粤中形胜古今同。\n问君一种青囊诀，曾否能扶造化工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20781,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"朔雪凝寒歛众芳，梅花无恙试新妆。\n乾坤别有阳和力，伴送风檐一段香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20782,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"游人重引岁寒思，记得梅花欲发时。\n春事故园应较早，北枝容易接南枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20783,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水舟中与族兄弟话别","author":"卢龙云","text":"行行谁解慰飘蓬，尊酒怜君意气雄。\n仗剑他年辞故里，五陵衣马直须同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20784,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒋虞部招集分署二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"舟中逃暑懒逢迎，长日科头谢友生。\n何事仙郎解相识，临流觞咏转多情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20785,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒋虞部招集分署二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"数椽精舍倚江开，有客停桡入户来。\n河朔一尊堪对饮，况逢千里故人杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20786,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初入邯郸境谒吕翁祠口占","author":"卢龙云","text":"大陆秋澄旅邸开，停鞍一眺吕仙台。\n相迎父老应含笑，前度卢生今又来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20787,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题春草池塘卷送邓生访其从兄别驾","author":"卢龙云","text":"江北江南路几千，春风容易老华年。\n谢家兄弟多相似，不识何人是惠连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20788,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过豫让桥二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"匹马踟蹰度石桥，寒沙古木共萧萧。\n总缘国士恩难报，留得英雄恨未销。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20789,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过豫让桥二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"千年气节未沉沦，自许孤忠愧后人。\n报主若论恩厚薄，似君犹是二心臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20790,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜老母至","author":"卢龙云","text":"望尽云山粤海边，到来消息喜真传。\n遥知弟妹灯前语，不分天涯綵服偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20791,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送贾中丞抚甘肃四首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"饮马居延志复东，谁还五利策和戎。\n军声稍似平淮后，雪里人人识晋公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":20792,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]